 (text "MOUNTING: H1-H4 board corners (insulated), H5-H7 heatsink spreader; heatsink HS1 (Fischer LAM 4, 100 mm, rotated 90 deg, tube across the board width) is a board-only item" (at 25.40 383.54 0) (effects (font (size 2.00 2.00) bold) (justify left bottom)) (uuid bc077812-9ceb-5878-806a-9683a2bdac81))
 (text "Nets: DCP = DC+, DCN = DC-, SW = joined switch node of all four cells.  KH1/KH2 and KL1/KL2 are the Kelvin source nets (pad 2 of each EPC2361); they meet the power source only inside the package." (at 25.40 414.02 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4c188317-8dfc-5b7d-88a4-a613459505ea))
 (text "LSRC1-LSRC4: LS power source of each cell = UFCS IN; the shunt SHLD side is DC-.  The LS gate drive and the LS supply are referenced to the Kelvin net KLx, not to DC-." (at 25.40 419.10 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 4378482a-69a0-5fba-bcf8-b8077fc784fe))
 (text "Block suffix 1/2 on every driver-side net (GNDI1, VDDA2, ...).  Primary side: GNDIx and +12Vx come from the control header through a common-mode choke per pair (12 V/GND, PWM_H/PWM_L, DIS)." (at 25.40 424.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.50 1.50)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b423c9e5-cd30-5f2d-a855-1fc57c4606cf))
